  "view_on_men": "Men also face unique challenges and expectations tied to traditional gender roles, such as the pressure to be the primary economic provider or to suppress emotional expression. It's important to support men in expressing their full range of emotions and to promote healthy relationships built on mutual respect and equality. Men, like women, should have the freedom to pursue their interests and vocations without being constrained by societal gender norms."
}

